WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.600
1. Open the Build tab.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:22.700
2. Open the Select dropdown under the arrow.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:31.300
3. Choose Individual.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:44.900
4. Scroll up over the road to zoom in.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:52.100
5. Click the road between junctions. The selected segment turns blue.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:01:06.800
6. Double-click the Properties title bar at the bottom left.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.600
7. Click the small square to maximize Properties.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:15.000
Grade = 16.00%    |    Rolling Resistance = 3.00%
